# Incident Time Machine — environment variables template.
#
# The Forge runtime injects its own credentials; this app needs NO third-party
# services and NO secrets to run. Keep this file as documentation only.
#
# Optional (unused by default): if you later add an external LLM polish layer,
# put its key here and reference it via forge environment variables:
#   forge variables set --encrypt LLM_API_KEY=...
# LLM_API_KEY=
